# NOTICE — Third-party attribution

This repository contains trained weights of the model **RuBERT (Russian emotion
classification, text)**. The weights are derived from the following third-party
components.

## Pretrained models

| Component | Source | License | Relation |
|---|---|---|---|
| DeepPavlov RuBERT (`rubert-base-cased`) | <https://huggingface.co/DeepPavlov/rubert-base-cased> | Apache-2.0 | The checkpoint contains a fine-tuned copy of the backbone: layers 0–5 frozen, layers 6–11 further tuned on the emotion task, plus a new classification head |

State changes relative to the base model: added a `Linear → GELU → Dropout →
Linear` classification head; fine-tuned encoder layers 6–11 on `dusha_resd_train`.
Attribution requirements of Apache-2.0 apply (see `LICENSE`).

## Training data

| Dataset | Source | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dusha (Salute Developers / Sber) | <https://github.com/salute-developers/golos/tree/master/dusha> · arXiv:2212.12266 | Dusha/Golos, attribution + share-alike (a reworked CC BY-SA 4.0) | Corpus `dusha_resd` is built from Dusha + RESD (see `CORPUS.md` in the code repo) |
| RESD (`Aniemore/resd_annotated`) | <https://huggingface.co/datasets/Aniemore/resd_annotated> · DOI 10.57967/hf/1272 | MIT | Only the 4 target emotions are retained |

